description=Local-only rooted modem control for Z Flip 5: loopback bearer API, thermal-gated safe-5G/tether, owner-only redacted SMS over Tailscale. No public bind. Optional bench mode lifts the thermal gate for battery-less donor hardware (explicit opt-in, 70C trip).
